--- !u!114 &1544240944
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544240921}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 841589fc622bc494aa5405f416fa1301, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Menu
  itemId: 20
  indentLevel: 0
  text: Well, I guess some loves never die. I believe in myself and in this club.
    We'll get back where we belong.
  description: 
  targetBlock: {fileID: 1544240943}
  hideIfVisited: 0
  interactable:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 1
  setMenuDialog: {fileID: 0}
  hideThisOption:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 0
--- !u!114 &1544240945
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544240921}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 19
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: But tell me something, lad. Why did you come back? Do you really think
    you can bring the old Bramwick Town back to its glory days?
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1544240946
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544240921}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 18
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: Aye, well... That tight-fisted chairman hasn't changed one bit. Still
    won't spend a penny if he can help it!
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1544240947
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544240921}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 17
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: Come on, Arthur. 'Lately' is putting it kindly. It's been years!
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1544240948
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544240921}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 16
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: Anyway, as you probably know, we haven't exactly been setting the world
    alight lately...
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1544240949
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544240921}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 15
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: I still remember you as a little boy, flying into tackles like a bloody
    animal! Hahaha!
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1544240950
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544240921}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 14
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: You've got some nerve, lad! But then again, you always did.
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1544240951
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544240921}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 13
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: And yes, I'm back. Seems you lot just can't manage without me.
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1544240952
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544240921}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 12
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: Good old Arthur! Still sweeping up leaves, I see. At least the rain's
    stopped now.
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1544240953
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544240921}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 11
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: Although, from what I've heard, things haven't exactly been going much
    better for you than they have for us!
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1544240954
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544240921}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 10
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: Well, well! Look who's back! Little Jamie Calder! Had enough of the
    big city already?
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1544240955
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544240921}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 9
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: There it is. Bramwick Town Football Club. Somehow, it looks even smaller
    than I remember.
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
